    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d208-a7">

                <pb facs="0301" n="193" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg193"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7 in No.
                    10—Telegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic">June 1,
                        1893</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the Commissioners of the Supreme
                        Government Dr Modesto Barrios, Don José Francisco Aguilar, and Don Hipolito
                        Saballos, jr.:</hi></p>
                <p>The agreement of peace agreed upon yesterday at Sabana Grande has also been
                    approved on the part of the revolutionary junta.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. Alvarez</hi>,</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Octaviano César</hi>,</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ascension P. Rivas.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
